<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2JN" style="id">Engungwel</book>
  <para style="h">2 DZAÃ</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ɔ̃nkaan wa mviaal wa Dzaã</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Dzaã</para>
  <para style="toc3">2Dz</para>
  <para style="mt2">Ɔ̃nkaan wa mviaal wa</para>
  <para style="mt1">Dzaã</para>
  <para style="imt1">Obɛɛn b'ɔ̃nkaan</para>
  <para style="ip">Ɔ̃nkaan wa mviaal wu, Dzaã wu áswɛn ndɛ olieel ndiri ndɛ oli «ɔ̃kuul a Ebvɔɔn» (<char style="xt"><ref loc="2JN 1:1">1</ref></char>). Ndɛ áyuɔɔl ndɛ ol'ɔ̃kaal wu ésueel Nziã ye baan a ndɛ. Ɛ̃nkaan mikyɛ ɛ̃yɛɛn ndiri ɔ̃kaal ondɛ esuo Ebvɔɔn lɛn akiool ali baan a ndɛ.</para>
  <para style="ip">Onse ɔ̃nkaan wa mviaal wu, Dzaã oswɛn ãndɔɔ ãpfi-ãpfi me ndɔɔ yɛn ndɛ tsɔɔn amaaswɛn mɔ̃ onse ɔ̃nkaan a ndɛ wu ɛ̃kwel. Ndɛ ayɛɛn y'ɔ̃tɛɛ̃ wueel me ndɔɔ yi etal ngel a dzii bvool me ndɔɔ otaa-taa (<char style="xt"><ref loc="2JN 1:1">1</ref>,<ref loc="2JN 1:4-11">4-11</ref></char>). Ndɛ awa akilisito ãnkunkwa me ndɔɔ ataal a Mãsia (<char style="xt"><ref loc="2JN 1:7">7</ref></char>). Ataal obɔ k'ákekiool ndiri Yeso Mãsia áyi m'emfa ki ombuul wɛ. Obɔ otsɛn bɛn, Dzaã asuo emfa ki akal ke nkwel a bɔ, m'ãyɛɛn mã: «ebee ndɛ ola byɛ oyɔɔ, ebee onkyam k'ebio ndɛ...» (<char style="xt"><ref loc="2JN 1:10">10</ref>,<ref loc="2JN 1:11">11</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="ie" />
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2JN 1" />
  <para style="s1">Ɔ̃bio</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2JN 1:1" />Mɛ̃ wu ɔ̃kuul, mɛ̃ nswɛn ɔ̃nkaan wu ola yɛ wu ɔ̃kaal wu ésueel Nziã<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɛ̃nkaan mikyɛ ɛ̃yɛɛn ndiri ɔ̃kaal ondɛ esuo Ebvɔɔn lɛn baan a ndɛ ali baal a lɔ.</char></note> bvool ola baan a yɛ, bɛn mɛ̃ ndyam nzii onse otaa-taa. Wu odzii bɔ k'eli kɛn a myam wɛ, baal bueel b'ayɛɛ otaa-taa hɛ̃ adzii bɔ. <verse eid="2JN 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2JN 1:2" />Bee edzii byɛ, me ndɔɔ yɛn otaa-taa obekal onse bia-byɛ bvool òkal ye bia-byɛ kɛn okal. <verse eid="2JN 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2JN 1:3" />Nziã wu Taal, ye Yeso Mãsia wu Muaan a Taal àsio bia-byɛ nyiĩ, àyoo bia-byɛ ãwua, bvool àwa bia-byɛ opi, kwɛn bia-byɛ ekal onse otaa-taa bvool onse dzii.<verse eid="2JN 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Odzuu onse otaa-taa ye dzii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2JN 1:4" />Mɛ̃ ndi y'esɛ ngamfɛn ŋ'emwɛn mɛ̃ kwɛn baan a yɛ bakyɛ abekal onse otaa-taa onge b'etam Taal bia-byɛ osa. <verse eid="2JN 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2JN 1:5" />Bvool meba, yɛ wu ɔ̃kaal wu, tal b'esɔɔ mɛ̃ ola yɛ: Bia-byɛ edzii bakyɛ. K'eli ngel yi nyiɔɔn yi nswɛn mɛ̃ yɛ wɛ, eli ngel yi éyɔɔ bia-byɛ fa obɛɛn. <verse eid="2JN 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2JN 1:6" />Dzii emã? Eli ŋ'edzuu bia-byɛ m'emfa ki etam ãngel ã Nziã. Oyɔ ngel yɛn ebvaan byɛ edzuu onse yɔ, onge b'éyoo byɛ yɔ fa obɛɛn.<verse eid="2JN 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2JN 1:7" />Ke ngwel wɛ, baal a mfya bibi apal m'ɔ̃kiri. Bɔ abebee k'akiool ndiri taa-taa Yeso Mãsia áyi m'emfa ki ombuul. Okyɛ emfa ki eli nga-mfya y'ɔ̃taal a Mãsia. <verse eid="2JN 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2JN 1:8" />Oŋɔ̃ ekal y'onkyab me byam kwɛn byɛ ebee furu li ɔ̃sal a bia-byɛ oywɛn, kɛn a byɛ èbɔɔ ebvakab e byɛ kieel. <verse eid="2JN 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2JN 1:9" />Mbuul wueel wu oyɛn me pyɛ, bvool k'akal onse ãtee ã Mãsia wɛ, k'ali ye Nziã wɛ. Mbuul wu akal onse ãtee omɔ̃, oli ye Tal ye Muaan. <verse eid="2JN 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2JN 1:10" />Ŋɛn mbuul oyetal byɛ, k'ayi y'ãtee mã wɛ, ebee ndɛ ola byɛ oyɔɔ, ebee onkyam k'ebio ndɛ. <verse eid="2JN 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2JN 1:11" />Mbuul wu abio ndɛ ŋ'ali ɔ̃nguo ngɔmɔ̃ ye ndɛ onse ɛ̃sal ɛ̃ ndɛ mi ɛ̃bi-ɛ̃bi.<verse eid="2JN 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Onse okiaal me ndɔɔ yi ayetal bakyɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2JN 1:12" />Mɛ̃ ndi y'ãndɔɔ bibi m'eswɛn byɛ, kɛn a mɛ̃ ke nzii k'eswɛn byɛ mɔ̃ m'oswɛn wɛ. Mɛ̃ ndi ye kaã li eya ola byɛ, me ndɔɔ yɛn mɛ̃ ngyɛɛn ye byɛ nsɔ̃-a-nsɔ̃, kwɛn esɛ e bia-byɛ ekal ɔ̃koo. <verse eid="2JN 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2JN 1:13" />Baan a muaan-ngoo a yɛ wu ɔ̃kaal, wu ésueel Nziã, abio yɛ.<verse eid="2JN 1:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2JN 1" />
</usx>